"mx-0 border border-b border-l-0 border-r-0 border-t border-gray-300 py-4 md:ml-8 md:mr-24\\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\\"font-stretch-ultra-condensed mb-2 text-lg font-semibold uppercase\\\">Recommended by Our Editors<\\/h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex flex-wrap\\\">\\n                            <div class=\\\"my-4 inline-flex w-full md:my-2\\\">\\n                    <a class=\\\"mr-4 inline min-w-24 max-w-24 no-underline md:min-w-28 md:max-w-28\\\" data-module=\\\"related-recirc\\\" data-item=\\\"related-recirc-list\\\" data-element=\\\"related-recirc-image\\\" data-position=\\\"1\\\" data-title=\\\"OpenAI Cropped Image\\\" href=\\\"\\/news\\/openai-pauses-training-and-evaluation-of-its-most-advanced-models\\\" x-track-ga-click>\\n                                                    <div class=\\\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden\\\">\\n                                <img class=\\\"absolute inset-1\\/2 h-auto w-auto translate-center\\\" data-image-loader=\\\"https:\\/\\/i.pcmag.com\\/imagery\\/articles\\/04VVLYH9wstPbztPdyZNkgT-1.fit_lpad.size_400x225.v1790615916.jpg\\\" data-lazy-sized src=\\\"data:image\\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2000\\/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20400%20225'%3E%3Crect%20fill='%23f7f7f7'%20\\/%3E%3C\\/svg%3E\\\" alt=\\\"OpenAI Cropped Image\\\">\\n                            <\\/div>\\n                                            <\\/a>\\n                    <div class=\\\"flex w-auto flex-col justify-center md:mr-20\\\">\\n                        <a class=\\\"inline-block align-middle leading-tight no-underline\\\" data-module=\\\"related-recirc\\\" data-item=\\\"related-recirc-list\\\" data-element=\\\"related-recirc-link\\\" data-position=\\\"1\\\" href=\\\"\\/news\\/openai-pauses-training-and-evaluation-of-its-most-advanced-models\\\" aria-label=\\\"OpenAI Pauses Training and Evaluation of Its 'Most Advanced Models'\\\" x-track-ga-click>OpenAI Pauses Training and Evaluation of Its 'Most Advanced Models'<\\/a>\\n                    <\\/div>\\n                <\\/div>\\n                            <div class=\\\"my-4 inline-flex w-full md:my-2\\\">\\n                    <a class=\\\"mr-4 inline min-w-24 max-w-24 no-underline md:min-w-28 md:max-w-28\\\" data-module=\\\"related-recirc\\\" data-item=\\\"related-recirc-list\\\" data-element=\\\"related-recirc-image\\\" data-position=\\\"2\\\" data-title=\\\"A restaurant table in New York City\\\" href=\\\"\\/news\\/did-ai-take-your-table-youre-fighting-agents-for-popular-restaurant-bookings\\\" x-track-ga-click>\\n                                                    <div class=\\\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden\\\">\\n                                <img class=\\\"absolute inset-1\\/2 h-auto w-auto translate-center\\\" data-image-loader=\\\"https:\\/\\/i.pcmag.com\\/imagery\\/articles\\/044egJLuNrF3NYGd9sE5FoY-1.fit_lpad.size_400x225.v1790261339.jpg\\\" data-lazy-sized src=\\\"data:image\\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2000\\/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20400%20225'%3E%3Crect%20fill='%23f7f7f7'%20\\/%3E%3C\\/svg%3E\\\" alt=\\\"A restaurant table in New York City\\\">\\n                            <\\/div>\\n                                            <\\/a>\\n                    <div class=\\\"flex w-auto flex-col justify-center md:mr-20\\\">\\n                        <a class=\\\"inline-block align-middle leading-tight no-underline\\\" data-module=\\\"related-recirc\\\" data-item=\\\"related-recirc-list\\\" data-element=\\\"related-recirc-link\\\" data-position=\\\"2\\\" href=\\\"\\/news\\/did-ai-take-your-table-youre-fighting-agents-for-popular-restaurant-bookings\\\" aria-label=\\\"Did AI Take Your Table? You're Fighting Agents for Popular Restaurant Bookings\\\" x-track-ga-click>Did AI Take Your Table? You're Fighting Agents for Popular Restaurant Bookings<\\/a>\\n                    <\\/div>\\n                <\\/div>\\n                            <div class=\\\"my-4 inline-flex w-full md:my-2\\\">\\n                    <a class=\\\"mr-4 inline min-w-24 max-w-24 no-underline md:min-w-28 md:max-w-28\\\" data-module=\\\"related-recirc\\\" data-item=\\\"related-recirc-list\\\" data-element=\\\"related-recirc-image\\\" data-position=\\\"3\\\" data-title=\\\"The seal of the Federal Bureau of Investigation (FBI), part of the U.S. Department of Justice, is displayed at the J. Edgar Hoover Building in Washington, DC.\\\" href=\\\"\\/news\\/shinyhunters-hits-the-fbi-fake-lastpass-installers-and-a-459m-google-fine\\\" x-track-ga-click>\\n                                                    <div class=\\\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden\\\">\\n                                <img class=\\\"absolute inset-1\\/2 h-auto w-auto translate-center\\\" data-image-loader=\\\"https:\\/\\/i.pcmag.com\\/imagery\\/articles\\/03pELFLFbtZnvuR4Bdskbdr-1.fit_lpad.size_400x225.v1790264947.jpg\\\" data-lazy-sized src=\\\"data:image\\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2000\\/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20400%20225'%3E%3Crect%20fill='%23f7f7f7'%20\\/%3E%3C\\/svg%3E\\\" alt=\\\"The seal of the Federal Bureau of Investigation (FBI), part of the U.S. Department of Justice, is displayed at the J. Edgar Hoover Building in Washington, DC.\\\">\\n                            <\\/div>\\n                                            <\\/a>\\n                    <div class=\\\"flex w-auto flex-col justify-center md:mr-20\\\">\\n                        <a class=\\\"inline-block align-middle leading-tight no-underline\\\" data-module=\\\"related-recirc\\\" data-item=\\\"related-recirc-list\\\" data-element=\\\"related-recirc-link\\\" data-position=\\\"3\\\" href=\\\"\\/news\\/shinyhunters-hits-the-fbi-fake-lastpass-installers-and-a-459m-google-fine\\\" aria-label=\\\"ShinyHunters Hits the FBI, Fake LastPass Installers, and a $459M Google Fine: This Week's Cybersecurity Chaos\\\" x-track-ga-click>ShinyHunters Hits the FBI, Fake LastPass Installers, and a $459M Google Fine: This Week's Cybersecurity Chaos<\\/a>\\n                    <\\/div>\\n                <\\/div>\\n                    <\\/div>\\n    <\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<p>Meta was embroiled in a privacy scandal last week after an <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.inc.com\\/jason-aten\\/metas-new-muse-ai-agent-read-my-private-messages-i-never-asked-it-to\\/91408202\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" title=\\\"(Opens in a new tab)\\\">Inc writer<\\/a> found that Muse was reading their personal messages without permission. The tool told the writer it didn&rsquo;t have access to full messages, despite evidence to the contrary.<\\/p><p>At launch, Meta said Muse is built \\\"from the ground up to be a safe, secure, private, and widely available personal AI agent.\\\" Meta did not immediately respond to a request for comment.<\\/p>\",\"articleSection\":\"Security\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-09-28T09:53:41+00:00\",\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"PCMag\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.pcmag.com\\/images\\/pcmag-social-share.png\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":1200},\"alternateName\":\"PCMag\",\"sameAs\":[\"https:\\/\\/twitter.com\\/PCMag\",\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/PCMag\",\"https:\\/\\/www.pinterest.com\\/pcmag\",\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/@PCMag\",\"https:\\/\\/www.flipboard.com\\/@PCMag\",\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/pcmag\\/\"],\"description\":\"PCMag is your complete guide to PC computers, peripherals and upgrades. We test and review computer- and Internet-related products and services, report technology news and trends, and provide shopping advice and price comparisons.\"},\"author\":[{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"James Peckham\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.pcmag.com\\/authors\\/james-peckham\",\"jobTitle\":\"Reporter\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/i.pcmag.com\\/imagery\\/authors\\/00Zz7ZrC4fLkQln4qqrqqRx..v1744726956.jpg\",\"height\":1772,\"width\":1771}}],\"keywords\":\"Security, AI, Meta\",\"image\":[{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\